<title>NETHERLANDS: SNS Securities ups Endemol to a Buy.</title>
<headline>SNS Securities ups Endemol to a Buy.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1997-04-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Summary of April 16 research.</p>
<p>    Company------Sector-----------Price-----Broker--------------</p>
<p>    Endemol	TV production    52.50     SNS Securities</p>
<p>COMMENT: Buy (vs Hold)</p>
<p>Analysts meeting bolstered long term confidence in Endemol, eventhough interim results were somewhat disappointing. Earnings per share estimates reduced, mostly because of disappointing results of subsidiary Holiday On Ice. Recent drop in share price has reduced rich valuation and today the shares dropped to an irresistibly low level. We raise our Hold recommendation to Buy.  </p>
<p>    Estimates (NLG):  EPS     pvs EPS   P/E    Dividend</p>
<p>    1996/97	     2.26    (2.45)    23.2   0.70</p>
<p>    1997/98	     2.66    (2.78)    19.7   0.80</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom, +31 20 504 5000 (Fax +31 20 504 5040)</p>
